  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INTERCULT st&#xf6;der Childrens Theatre Centre i Skopje, CTC, som g&#xf6;r en tunr&#xe9; i Kosovo med en pj&#xe4;s (uppsatt i Stlm). Vidare utbildar man tv&#xe5; kulturarbetare i management. M&#xe5;lgruppen &#xe4;r barn och ungdom.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERCULT supports The Children4s Theatre Centre i Skopje which enables it to make a tour iwth a play for childrens en youth into Kosovo. INTERCULT also trains a couple of cultural administrators from the Bal- kans. The target group is children and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
